  "question": {
    "text": "For a complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>Z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is (here <math><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)"
  },
